#!/usr/bin/env bash
# klippel-gov: how Instituto Klippel's team governs KlippelGo.
#
# The governor's guardian is the team council (contracts/src/TeamCouncil.sol, docs/governance.md). This tool
# signs as one member of the team: it asks the council for an action, approves, cancels or executes one, and
# reads what the council and the protocol hold. Whether an action needs other members' approvals, and how long
# it waits, is the council's to say, never this tool's: it shows it before sending.
#
# See gov/README.md. Needs Foundry's `cast` and `jq`.
